WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Cash-on-delivery orders move fast.

00:07.000 --> 00:17.000
But when customers do not confirm, merchants pay for failed delivery attempts, reverse shipping, and hours of manual follow-up.

00:17.000 --> 00:25.000
Akeed automates COD confirmation on WhatsApp using official Meta Cloud APIs.

00:25.000 --> 00:34.000
When a new COD order arrives, Akeed sends a branded confirmation flow to the customer.

00:34.000 --> 00:45.000
The customer confirms the order, checks the delivery address, and responds in a clear, structured conversation.

00:45.000 --> 00:57.000
Your dashboard updates automatically, showing what is confirmed, canceled, pending, and how customers move through the confirmation funnel.

00:57.000 --> 01:08.000
You can track response rate, monitor recent verifications, and see the shipping waste you are avoiding.

01:08.000 --> 01:18.000
Setup is simple for most stores, with no WhatsApp number or API setup required to start.

01:18.000 --> 01:24.000
Ship with more confidence.

01:24.000 --> 01:32.000
Akeed: reliable WhatsApp COD confirmation for MENA commerce.
